WEBVTT

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.900
That's it there.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.110
Commencing our descent.

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.230
Mister, what is this place?

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:51.500
Just a relic of the war.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.500
Are you scared?

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:56.550
No...  Just a little bit.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.650
Welcome back, Boss.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.920
Boss!

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.150
Good work today.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.700
Ah, Boss.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.660
Welcome back.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.340
It's good to be back.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.870
Guys, listen up.

00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:27.310
This is the legitimate heiress of the Anastasia Ruby:

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.660
Mikamo Chizuko-kun.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:30.580
Starting today, she'll be one of us.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.450
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.170
Please call me Chiko.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.990
She's just a little girl.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:39.380
And she looks like the daughter of some rich family too.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.930
"One of us?"  Is the boss serious about this?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:42.870
Come with me!

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:45.010
Chiko, I'll show you around the inside.

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.430
What's with Ken?

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:49.520
It's like he wants to be her older brother.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:50.850
Boss...

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:54.130
Skipper, please hurry with the preparations.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.180
Yes, sir.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:02:59.580
Kill the engine.

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.110
Try to land without them noticing.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:07.870
If this bad boy had been deployed, it would have been the largest battle tank in the world.

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.370
But since the war ended kind of abruptly,

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.290
now it's just our little hideout.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:18.340
Here you are, Fräulein Chiko.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.520
I'm Hans.  Nice to meet you.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.180
Thank you.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:24.800
My name's Yasu.  Please don't forget it.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.930
Likewise, Yasu-san.

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:29.930
This isn't the time for small talk.  We've a job to do.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:32.600
What's your problem, Skipper?  You're so cold.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.320
I don't agree with this.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.670
Having children hanging out with thieves.

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:40.420
But there must've been important circumstances that made the boss bring her–

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.710
Her circumstances don't matter.  Admit it!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.620
It's the same with me and you and everyone here.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.870
We can't go taking on any encumbrances.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.750
That's for sure.  If we're going to ditch her, we should do it now.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:55.480
We can't do that!  Don't you feel bad for Chiko?

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.180
Excuse me, but I'll work.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.760
Please tell me to do whatever.

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.930
Carry this outside.

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.280
Yes, sir.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:07.520
Wait a sec here.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.240
Chiko can't carry something that heavy–

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.120
If she's one of us, then she has to do what everyone else does.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.720
I'll do it.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.800
Heh, not bad.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:52.570
Chiko!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:57.280
She was being served poison.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:04:59.940
By her aunt and uncle.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.620
She's a bright girl.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:05.450
She figured it out quickly and started protecting herself.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.740
She managed to avoid receiving a lethal dose.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.960
How long are we going to let her lie here in the cold?!

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:18.220
Are children supposed to be this light?

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:21.600
Ken, get some sheets!  Make her a bed!

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.650
I'm on it!

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.550
So this is it?

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.630
Ah, you're awake.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.950
I've injected you with some nutrients.

00:05:34.950 --> 00:05:37.560
You should lie down for a while.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.120
We'll take off after you've rested a bit.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.340
We won't be returning to Japan for some time.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.070
There is no one waiting for me at home.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.550
I don't have...

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.070
...any family left there.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.750
This is the Anastasia Ruby.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.370
This belongs to you.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.370
It'll look good on you.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.870
Please...

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:01.880
I want you to hold on to it for me.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.890
Very well.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:07.940
I'll bear the responsibility of it's care until I restore it to you.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.600
Hey, are you awake?  I made you some porridge.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.100
It's my own special recipe.  Eat up.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.840
You're being unusually considerate, aren't you?

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:19.120
Thank you, Ken-niichan.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:21.210
I'm "Ken-niichan," Boss.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.230
That's great, Ken-niichan.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.370
It's delicious.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.920
I put in too much salt!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.730
You can leave it, Chiko.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.380
No, I really do think it's delicious.

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.290
Two groups go around on the left.

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.170
Don't let them notice you.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:49.920
Yes, sir!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.850
Those are the machine guns.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.060
Chiko, come with me!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.090
Hans!  Is it the police?

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.270
Yeah.  They got here quicker than we thought.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.460
Oh, Chiko.  Are you feeling better now?

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.070
Hey, it's time.  Help out.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:10.450
Chiko, wait right there.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.210
OK.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:17.780
And so it begins.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:19.790
Inspector!  The tank!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.670
All right, we're going to jump on.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.670
Rush it!

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:27.820
Don't go so slow!

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.010
They're right behind us!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:29.340
OK!

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.320
Arrest everyone without exception!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.720
Geez, this thing is huge.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.620
If this had been completed during the war...

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.860
Inspector, there's no one inside!

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:43.970
What?!

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:46.820
Damn, they're smarter than I thought.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.690
It stopped?

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.710
Inspector!

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:50.540
All the guns are being pointed upwards!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:51.570
What?!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.780
Evacuate!  We need to get the hell out of here!

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:18.350
So long, coppers!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.390
But was it really a good idea to have destroyed the tank?

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:26.650
It's better off having been destroyed.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:40.880
OK, when you're done bringing the luggage in, start cleaning and putting things in order.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:41.660
Hurry!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.040
Watch out, coming through!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:45.730
I'm sorry!

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:57.550
Boss, I hope it's OK.  I sent Hans and Goro to go shop for food.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.830
Yeah, that's fine.

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:04.980
Sir, if you're looking for food, I've brought plenty.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.440
Hey, Chen.  Thanks as always.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.830
Are you here for your work again?

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:11.690
I've got some great information.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:14.170
That's Chen.  He deals in intelligence.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.190
Since the boss maintains hideouts all over the world,

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:19.700
he has men from each and every location who help us out.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.230
Of course, we have enemies all over the world as well.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.710
The whereabouts of the Twenty Faces band is as yet undetermined.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.340
The possibility that they have fled to a foreign country is increasing.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:34.970
Honey, please relax.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.140
How can we relax?!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:40.220
As long as she's alive, we're...

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:44.970
So weak for a man.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:50.270
I'm pretty good, aren't I?

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:51.770
You wanna give it a shot?

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.610
Ken!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.000
We're having a meeting.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:55.890
Oh, sorry.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.690
We're going to be talking shop.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:09:59.590
Chiko, just play however you want.

00:10:11.330 --> 00:10:14.380
There's a damn pig who lives in a huge mansion about 10km east of here...

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:18.510
...who has used his wealth to procure the hand mirror of Xi Taihou.

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.580
From what Chen said, it's being stored in a stone warehouse at the back.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:26.270
Apparently there's a banquet taking place at the mansion tonight, so they're low on security staff.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:28.980
He says it should be easy to steal.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.780
Sounds good to me!  Let's do it!

00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:34.650
I'd rather go to the banquet.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:39.360
I'm against it.  I don't trust that Chen guy.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.870
I'm against it, too.  This sounds too good to be true.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.460
What are your thoughts, Boss?

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.160
Let's trust Chen's story.

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:50.870
We'll do the job tonight.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:54.720
To keep a low profile, only three people—myself, Skipper, and Ken—will go.

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:02.800
What's the matter, Chiko?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.390
Uhm...

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.810
Please tell me about the job, too.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:11.260
None of my comrades are under any obligation.

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:15.230
Everyone has found their own place here by themselves.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:20.340
What's important is to watch, listen, and think for themselves.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:23.500
If you do that, you'll find what you want to do on your own.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:29.330
Watch, listen, and think for myself...

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:33.590
Boss, the car's ready.

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:34.560
OK.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.420
Excuse me.  I'll go with you!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.110
Don't be foolish!

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:39.380
This isn't a game!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:42.960
We put our lives on the line out there!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:45.680
Remain on alert in the back with Skipper.

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.820
You must obey all orders without fail.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.180
Can you promise me you will?

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:51.180
Yes!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:58.020
I want to know more about him.

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:01.030
I want to get closer to him!

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:11.960
That's it.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:23.430
Damn it!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.790
So it was a trap.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.430
Just like Skipper said it would be.

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:30.290
They've made their move.

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:32.030
Now's the time to take it.

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.480
That's as far as you're getting.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.860
S-Sir!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.110
I-I thought you were going to the stone warehouse...

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:41.460
Betraying your own comrades and luring us into a trap...

00:12:41.460 --> 00:12:44.070
And at the same time snatching the all-important treasure...

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:46.110
How appropriate for a rat like you.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:51.250
I'm impressed as usual, sir.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.790
But you underestimate me.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.000
Drop it.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.100
My apologies but I'll be taking the treasure.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:04.780
I'll be disposing of you afterwards.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.350
Looks like the one who underestimated someone was you.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:19.570
That's the alarm.

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.110
Dang it, let's head to the mansion!

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.950
Man, that saved me.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.560
Thanks for your help, Ken.

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:28.570
Boss!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:31.080
No need to linger here.  Let's hurry.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.080
Boss!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.080
Skipper, get us out of here.

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.110
Hurry up, Chiko!

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.560
R-Right!

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:50.930
So you were planning on using the trap Chen set for us as a diversion from the start?

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:53.960
You saw through his lies right away!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.430
No one plays you for a fool, Boss!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.950
There's always something beneath the things people say.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:00.440
You need to keep your ears open and listen carefully.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:04.320
What's important is to watch, listen, and think for yourself.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.030
Die, you hoodlums!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:13.160
Chiko!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.470
I'm not planning to be a murderer.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.280
Serves them right!

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.600
Everyone all right back there?

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.720
Chiko, are you hurt?

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:43.610
I'm fine.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.960
Skipper, this car stands out too much.

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:52.120
Should we go there, then?

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.130
We don't seem very welcome here.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.320
This isn't part of any country.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:10.200
They don't welcome strangers here,

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.140
but it's a perfect place for us to hide.

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.690
Mister!

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:23.470
I was...

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:25.110
...a little careless.

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.110
Damn it.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.190
Were you shot?

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.110
And in a place like this.  This is bad.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.850
Are you guys Japanese?

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.150
All I have is porridge, but please help yourself.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:49.350
I'm sorry that he's taking up your bed.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:51.630
Miss, your Japanese is really good.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:56.510
I used to do business with the Japanese troops stationed here during the war.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.670
I like Japanese people.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:03.020
They always looked out for me.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.490
That's why I'm helping you.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.520
Also, that young girl...

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.090
...wouldn't be hanging out with bad people, would she?

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.780
You should eat, too.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:12.450
OK?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:15.030
Thank you very much.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.580
Chiko, can you take care of the boss by yourself until tomorrow afternoon?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.790
There are still people after us out there.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.780
It will take the two of us to go and call the rest of our comrades.

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:32.280
The only one who can protect the boss is you, Chiko.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:34.550
Yes.

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.000
Don't worry.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.550
Just keep an eye on him until we get back.

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.520
You'll be safe here.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.560
Those guys can't mess with us here.

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:47.350
Miss, please use this however you'd like.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:48.700
This much?

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:50.900
Well, now.  We're off.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:52.570
Chiko, we'll be back soon.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.510
Right.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:59.350
I'll keep an eye on him.  Hurry and eat up and go to bed.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:00.940
No.  I'll do it.

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:04.150
I see.  In that case, I'll go buy some medicine.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:05.580
Can you wait here alone?

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:07.510
OK.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.510
It's all because you saved me...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.970
Mister...

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.880
Come on out, Twenty Faces!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.280
Mister!

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:42.760
Father!  Mother!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.500
You're all alone again.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.360
Twenty Faces was just a figment of your imagination.

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:00.570
She's so warm.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:04.490
I have to protect him.

00:18:05.590 --> 00:18:06.830
Think.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.790
In this situation, what would he do?

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.660
What would he do?

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:16.340
What's important is to watch, listen, and think for yourself.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.670
Oh, you're awake.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:31.330
You probably couldn't sleep well sitting up like that.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:34.420
Also, it looks like his fever's gone down a bit.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:37.700
Were you watching him all night for me?

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.500
You did make a promise, after all.

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.290
OK, food's ready.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:43.480
Thank you.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.180
It'll be afternoon soon.

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:53.940
I'll go check downstairs.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:59.240
Don't go leaving while I'm not here.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.230
Twenty Faces won't be able to move for a while.

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.170
If you're going to grab him, now's the time.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:14.770
I understand.  I'll go get the rest of the guys from downstairs.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:17.380
He's the bounty we've been waiting for.  Don't let him escape.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.290
Shield the girl when the time comes.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.180
Yeah.

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:26.430
Ah, pardon me.

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:30.660
He says he's better now.

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:32.190
We have to get going.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:34.380
You really shouldn't be moving yet.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:36.150
I won't forget your kindness.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.070
Thank you.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:39.440
I see.  At least stay for some tea.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.700
They're all waiting for us.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.140
Take one step and the girl gets it!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:51.000
You seemed so kind, just like my mother.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.600
But I have to protect him.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.880
Forgive me.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:10.520
Keeping one's ears open and listening carefully is the art of a thief.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.190
Chiko, you did well.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.640
Hey!

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:18.980
Boss!  Chiko!

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.900
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:26.330
What will this child grow up to be?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.490
Do you intend to turn her into a cold-hearted fiend?

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:34.150
Have you ever thought that you could dedicate the rest of your life to someone else?

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:38.300
Have you ever shuddered at your own blessings and sinfulness?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.000
That's what I'm feeling now.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.300
Farewell.

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:55.680
She protected the boss from a group of bounty hunters.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.940
The girl did?

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:05.350
You did it!

00:21:07.810 --> 00:21:09.470
That was great, Chiko!
